 R←Test_Misc_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;res;tempDir;rc;msg
⍝ Runs the "GetMostRecentAncestor" method on the second branch of the fixture.
⍝ Note that this works on a private copy of the fixture: switching branches in ∆Folder4 would
⍝ leave that shared fixture behind in a state later test cases do not expect.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 tempDir←FilesAndDirs.GetTempSubDir'APLGit2-',⊃⎕SI
 (##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/TestData/CiderProject4.zip')ZipArchive.UnzipTo tempDir
 {}tempDir G.U.RunGitCommand'checkout feature'
 →T.GoToTidyUp'feature'≢G.CurrentBranch tempDir

 res←G.GetMostRecentAncestor tempDir
 →T.GoToTidyUp 1≠≡res
 →T.GoToTidyUp 40≠≢res

 R←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 (rc msg)←FilesAndDirs.RmDirByForce tempDir
 msg Assert rc=0
⍝Done
